WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:12.280
Holler at your boy one time! This
week on Thug Notes we gettin twisted with

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:16.160
The Catcher in the Rye by J.D. Salinger.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:22.220
This book tell the story of Holden
Caulfield, a 16 year white boy who start talkin

00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:26.080
about the events that got his ass slung up
in a mental hospital.

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:29.720
You see, last Christmas, Holden got
kicked out of his prissy private school for

00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:36.010
flunking all his classes, cept English! Holla!
So then he drops in on his old teach, Spencer,

00:00:36.010 --> 00:00:38.520
who tells him that he gotta get his sh%# together.

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:42.989
Later, Holden rolls up to his crib
where he throws down with his roomie Stradlater,

00:00:42.989 --> 00:00:45.590
who be mackin some girl 
Holden used to holler at.

00:00:45.590 --> 00:00:49.190
After gettin his ass whooped,
Holden peaces out to New York City

00:00:49.190 --> 00:00:51.760
where he gonna lay low at the Edmont Hotel.

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:55.760
Now my boy comes clean to the
reader and admits he ain’t never busted his cherry,

00:00:55.760 --> 00:00:59.920
even though he say he always been
swimmin in trim. So he decide to get himself

00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:02.960
a pro named Sunny and get his freak on.

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:08.180
When Sunny rolls up to his crib, Holden chokes 
like a bitch and say he just wanna talk.

00:01:08.180 --> 00:01:10.960
Then Sunny try to shake my boy
down for mo cash,

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:13.980
but Holden ain’t backin down and kicks her ass out.

00:01:13.980 --> 00:01:18.340
Next thing you know, Sunny’s pimp
Maurice busts in, bitch slaps Holden,

00:01:18.340 --> 00:01:20.200
and jacks dat paper son.

00:01:20.200 --> 00:01:23.900
So Holden eventually decide he
gonna see his baby sister Phoebe,

00:01:23.900 --> 00:01:30.140
who axe him what he wanna be about. Holden says he
sees himself in a big field of rye full of kids,

00:01:30.140 --> 00:01:34.320
where he be standing at the cliff catchin
any little homies who bout to fall off.

00:01:34.320 --> 00:01:39.220
Now when his folks come home, Holden
slips out to kick it with his old teach Mr. Antolini.

00:01:39.220 --> 00:01:43.700
But Holden gotta bail when he thinks
that creepy cat be feelin him up while he sleep

00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:48.280
At this point, Holden be bout to
straight lose his sh**, so he decide to

00:01:48.280 --> 00:01:53.600
get the hell outta dodge. His sista Phoebe
wanna join up, but he shuts her ass down.

00:01:53.600 --> 00:01:56.460
Phoebe gets all amped and tells
him to shut his trap.

00:01:56.460 --> 00:02:00.540
So Holden apologizes to Phoebe and
takes her to the zoo where he enjoys

00:02:00.540 --> 00:02:02.520
watchin her kick it on the carousel.

00:02:02.520 --> 00:02:06.580
At this point, Holden say all he
wanna say. He could talk about how he got

00:02:06.580 --> 00:02:10.060
sick and got locked up, 
but he just ain’t feeling it.

00:02:13.700 --> 00:02:17.620
A true playa might say that Catcher
illustrates how Holden tryin to find stability

00:02:17.620 --> 00:02:22.580
and acceptance in a broken society full of
people that always be fakin. But when that

00:02:22.580 --> 00:02:26.220
fool come up empty handed, he gotta get real
and buck the system.

00:02:26.220 --> 00:02:30.340
Now break yo-self for this here symbol,
blood. By turning around his hunting hat,

00:02:30.340 --> 00:02:34.120
Holden be tellin us that his values be the
reverse of the rest of society’s.

00:02:34.120 --> 00:02:38.380
And if you rollin like a G, you probably noticed
that be the same way baseball catchers wear

00:02:38.380 --> 00:02:41.920
their hat, foreshadowing his role as the 
Catcher in the Rye.

00:02:42.680 --> 00:02:46.900
And unless you peep this quote that
be explaining the title, you be actin a straight phony

00:02:54.240 --> 00:02:58.640
On the literal, Holden be saving
kids from fallin off a cliff, but figuratively

00:02:58.650 --> 00:03:02.680
he saving them from the all the bent-ass shit
of adulthood. Even though they ain’t nothing

00:03:02.680 --> 00:03:06.900
Holden can do to stop the pure world of children
from changing to the fake-ass world of adults,

00:03:06.900 --> 00:03:10.660
he gonna buck it for hisself and other little
homies for as long as he can.

00:03:10.660 --> 00:03:14.660
So when Holden preachin about the
glass cases up in the Museum, what he really

00:03:14.660 --> 00:03:17.860
saying is that he don’t wanna join the ranks
of them fake- ass adults.

00:03:17.860 --> 00:03:21.760
He wanna freeze time just like 
dem plastic playas behind the glass.

00:03:22.180 --> 00:03:25.620
That’s why the only one he can
keep it real with is his baby sister Phoebe.

00:03:25.620 --> 00:03:29.620
But that ain’t cuttin it. Holden be
trippin cuz he got a legit desire to search

00:03:29.640 --> 00:03:34.180
for beauty in human contact, but just ain’t
finding it in a world of such ugliness.

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:37.800
This is what makes Holden one of the loneliest 
playas in all of literature.

00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:41.360
He keeps it so real, while errybody else frontin’.

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:45.980
But as much as Holden be spittin that 
righteous talk, he sure as hell ain’t no prince.

00:03:45.980 --> 00:03:50.000
Like he say: “I’m the most
terrific liar you ever saw in your life.”

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:54.400
And although he want you to think he hard,
homeboy got a gentle soul. That’s why he

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:59.000
always askin what them ducks in the central
park lake gonna do once the water freezes over.

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:04.300
So, in the end, this gangsta pays the price 
for bein too soft in a world twisted by deceit:

00:04:04.300 --> 00:04:08.000
By spendin his days in a 
psych ward. Damn.

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:12.060
Yo thanks for checkin in, I’ll
catch you next week my well-read ballas.

